{
    "title": "Beat Battle Gorefield V2 Mod",
    "description": "This Weekend mod is about the return of Jon and Boyfriend vs. Gorefield in night battles, with better quality and funny content. In music battles, an adventure full of terrors awaits you!\r\n\r\nGorefield is a sadistic and psychopathic version of an old cartoon cat. This digital music night, Gorefield is also the main antagonist. BF will be battling VS Gorefield V2 all funny songs on very hard in an undertale universe. Girlfriend/GF is in the mod now who stands alongside Boyfriend/BF in 1 song. Undertale Sansfield and Char also makes an appearance.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Make arrows perfectly match.\r\n- Beat all enemies (weekend 1, Daddy dearest, Finn, Twiddlefinger, Silly Billy), climb to the top rank!\r\n- Feel digital rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Arrows fall follow digital melody\r\n- All mods Full enemies as you expected (Suicide mouse, Indie cross, Twiddlefinger)\r\n- Fantastic background with great sound effects\r\n- Always save your journey while you exit the game\r\n- Not require starting a new mode of play\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFollow us on social media platforms for any issues!",
    "descriptionHTML": "This Weekend mod is about the return of Jon and Boyfriend vs. Gorefield in night battles, with better quality and funny content. In music battles, an adventure full of terrors awaits you!<br><br>Gorefield is a sadistic and psychopathic version of an old cartoon cat. This digital music night, Gorefield is also the main antagonist. BF will be battling VS Gorefield V2 all funny songs on very hard in an undertale universe. Girlfriend/GF is in the mod now who stands alongside Boyfriend/BF in 1 song. Undertale Sansfield and Char also makes an appearance.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY?<br>- Make arrows perfectly match.<br>- Beat all enemies (weekend 1, Daddy dearest, Finn, Twiddlefinger, Silly Billy), climb to the top rank!<br>- Feel digital rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!<br><br>GAME FEATURE<br>- Arrows fall follow digital melody<br>- All mods Full enemies as you expected (Suicide mouse, Indie cross, Twiddlefinger)<br>- Fantastic background with great sound effects<br>- Always save your journey while you exit the game<br>- Not require starting a new mode of play<br>- Be updated frequently!<br><br>Have fun!<br>Follow us on social media platforms for any issues!",
